@format 1
@id media-loading.common.files-clear
@title Files clear
@section Media loading
@area Common
@entry clear-request
@summary Trace PListClear from a shared Files-clear request into the common docket-removal stage.
@related media-loading.common.docket-removal, media-loading.in-global-interface, media-loading.in-worklist
@tag media
@tag loading
@tag common
@tag removal

@alias list = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PList

[clear-request] Files clear request <input>
= A Files control or workspace-clear operation has invoked PListClear for one Files panel.
> clear-eligibility

[clear-eligibility] Unlocked Files availability <decision>
- Read every unlocked docket path and submit that set for removal only when the set is nonempty @ list.PListClear(...)
? "Unlocked paths exist" > map:media-loading.common.docket-removal
? "Nothing unlocked" > clear-nochange

[clear-nochange] Files clear changes nothing <output>
= PListClear submits no docket-removal request.
